Common ProgramParticipationStatus [3089]
    documentation "The status of the student's program participation."
    descriptor ParticipationStatus [3090]
        documentation "The student's program participation status."
        is part of identity
    date StatusBeginDate [3091]
        documentation "The date the student's program participation status began.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date StatusEndDate [3092]
        documentation "The date the student's program participation status ended.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    shared string DesignatedBy [3093]
        documentation "The person, organization, or department that designated the participation status."
        is optional
